zephyr-terminal (2.6.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New Qt 6 graphical terminal (zephyr-terminal): tabs, split panes,
    scrollback search, shell and SSH profiles, command palette, settings
    window and session restore.
  * Build with CMake (debhelper cmake+ninja); install desktop entry,
    AppStream metadata and hicolor icons.

 -- Charan Balaji <charanbalaji@zephyr.dev>  Mon, 16 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0000

zephyr-terminal (2.5.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Release Zephyr Terminal 2.5.0.
  * Universal prebuilt multi-distro installer for Ubuntu/Debian/Fedora/Arch/WSL.
  * VS Code auto-detection and default terminal integration.
  * Anonymous usage statistics and opt-in privacy telemetry.
  * Built-in GitHub authentication manager.

 -- Charan Balaji <charanbalaji@zephyr.dev>  Sat, 29 Aug 2026 12:00:00 +0000

zephyr-terminal (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release of Zephyr Terminal (C++20).
  * Includes Zephyr Shell with POSIX job control.
  * Includes local-only Zephyr AI engine.

